{
  "header": ["The page's extended plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, at most 5 minutes with every timeout counted,",
             "for when a longer play than the regular one (tools/play_plan.json) is needed: the launcher, Load ROM once the shader",
             "list Chrome builds behind it is done (Firefox builds none there, and its line saying so is the one waited for), Start",
             "Game, the intro, Start to the file select and A on Game 1, which on a new profile starts a new game. Its opening is",
             "skipped to Spiral Mountain as Start skips it once a save exists, and every place after it is reached by tools/warp.js,",
             "the request the game's own code leaves for a map change, each a need that fails the run unless the map asked for is",
             "the one playing: Spiral Mountain and Mumbo's Mountain, where Banjo walks to and fro, a little further out than back",
             "(the house's door is behind him in Spiral Mountain), jumps, attacks and turns the camera, about 25 s each; then",
             "Treasure Trove Cove's beach, Freezeezy Peak's snow and Mad Monster Mansion's grounds at night, about 25 s each of the",
             "shader plan's walk out and back about where he lands, jumps, attacks, eggs and the camera turned. Each place has a",
             "shot about 8 s in. Its waits and holds there are on the game's own clock, the seconds it adds each frame's length to",
             "(the struct at 0x8037E8E0's +8, read in 60ths), so every browser walks Banjo as far whatever frames it gives the game;",
             "the last step reads where Banjo is (player_position)."],
